  "bio": "Exotic Pleasures Tattoo, nestled in the heart of Glen Burnie, MD, has been mastering the art of illustrative ink for over two decades. Our seasoned team of artists brings a diverse range of styles and experiences to the table, ensuring that each client's vision is transformed into a stunning tattoo masterpiece with a personal touch. Step into our studio and let your skin become the canvas for exquisite designs that tell your unique story.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nIn business for over 30 yrs in the awesome town of glen burnie md. We have a team of artist with many specialties. Walk-ins welcome.",
